<title>CHINA: Shanghai Sanmao net falls 56.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Sanmao net falls 56.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	 115.09	 vs	   99.656</p>
<p> Net profit	 6.876	vs	   15.933</p>
<p> Net asset per share	2.82 yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.07 yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Shanghai Sanmao Co Ltd</p>
<p>. The figures are unaudited.</p>
